Heart: Oh... oh no... what have I done? Why wasn't I  more careful?! I shouldn't have listened to Mind. I should've known this was a trap!

<<pan Camera down>>   

Heart: I need to get out of here. I need to find Mind. I can't let them down. I can't let *myself* down. That tunnel has to let out somewhere. 

<<pan Camera right 4.2>>

Heart: I just need to keep moving. I can do this. I can get out of here. I can find Mind. I can save them.

Heart: That memento... what caused it to make the floor collapse? 
